* Package wrappers around the TI single-amplifier vendor models copied here.
* They only map dual-package pins; they do not model OPA1622 EN, GND, or EP.
.SUBCKT OPA1612_DUAL INPA INNA OUTA INPB INNB OUTB VPOS VNEG
XA INPA INNA VPOS VNEG OUTA OPA161x
XB INPB INNB VPOS VNEG OUTB OPA161x
.ENDS OPA1612_DUAL

* Physical symbol order: +A,-A,OUTA,+B,-B,OUTB,V+,V-,EN,GND,EP.
* EN/GND/EP are package pins; TI's single-channel macromodel has no EN pin.
.SUBCKT OPA1622_DUAL INPA INNA OUTA INPB INNB OUTB VPOS VNEG EN GND EP
XA INPA INNA VPOS VNEG OUTA OPA1622
XB INPB INNB VPOS VNEG OUTB OPA1622
.ENDS OPA1622_DUAL

* Behavioral level-shifted open-collector comparator, only for threshold tests.
* It is not a vendor LM339 macromodel; input offset, delay, and saturation are absent.
.SUBCKT LM339_OC INP INN OUT VCC VEE
BCTRL CTRL 0 V=if(V(INP,INN)<0,1,0)
SOUT OUT VEE CTRL 0 SWOC
.MODEL SWOC SW(RON=20 ROFF=1e12 VT=0.5 VH=0)
.ENDS LM339_OC

* Four comparator package, physical order follows Comparator:LM339 symbol pins.
.SUBCKT LM339_QUAD OUT1 OUT2 OUT3 OUT4 IN1N IN1P IN2N IN2P IN3N IN3P IN4N IN4P VCC VEE
X1 IN1P IN1N OUT1 VCC VEE LM339_OC
X2 IN2P IN2N OUT2 VCC VEE LM339_OC
X3 IN3P IN3N OUT3 VCC VEE LM339_OC
X4 IN4P IN4N OUT4 VCC VEE LM339_OC
.ENDS LM339_QUAD
